    "html": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"textColor\":\"very-light-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"customFontSize\":22} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;text-align:center\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-very-light-gray-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color\">Join us this Christmas Eve at 7 p.m. for the astounding new original Cantata, Celestial Prophecy, by composer and pianist Benjamin Belew as the liturgy of the word for our Eucharist Service! <br>We will have our choir as well as orchestral musicians bringing this beautiful piece to life, and will include sung Eucharist by our rector, the Rev. Jeff Dodge.  <br>Come early between 6-7p.m. for Covid-Safe outdoor refreshments, and a Carol Singalong in the Nave from 6:30-7p.m. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"backgroundColor\":\"very-light-gray\",\"customFontSize\":22} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;text-align:center\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-very-light-gray-background-color\">If joining us in person, masks and proof of vaccination are required. <br>If you would like to join us on Zoom, <br><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"click here (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89810110216?pwd=NGUzQlZ1ZEdjeTVaSThlM0J5NDkxQT09\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a></span></em></strong> for the event.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"textColor\":\"very-light-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"customFontSize\":22} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;text-align:center\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-very-light-gray-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color\"><em>This will be a perfect way to complete a most challenging year for us all!</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
