    "excerpt": "St. Anne's is grateful for the generosity of our local Boy Scouts in providing improvements to our grounds. The following are our current projects: New Landscaping Brian Cisto has continued the work by fellow scouts Char…",
    "html": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"customFontSize\":18} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\"><em><strong>St. Anne's is grateful for the generosity of our local Boy Scouts in providing improvements to our grounds. The following are our current projects:</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"normal\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\"><strong>New Landscaping </strong><br>Brian Cisto has continued the work by fellow scouts Charith Vemuru and Siddhant Chakraborty in installing seating areas and drought-resistant landscaping on the left-facing front corner of our property.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"normal\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\"><strong>Playground Restoration<br></strong>Vedant Madabushi has restored the fencing around our playground, repainted the equipment, and replaced broken furnishings. This ensures that our playground is a fun and safe place for all our neighbors and friends to use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Little Free Libraries</strong> <br>Eagle Scout Alex He has provided us with a Little Free Library box. Little Free Libraries promotes neighborhood book exchanges&nbsp;via a public bookcase. Anyone is welcome to put in a book or take out a book.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Common Grounds Garden Beds</strong><br>Eagle Scout Salil Khare has built more beds for our Common Grounds Community Garden Project. We'll keep you posted as this program develops in the coming months!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
