    "published": "2018-09-05",
    "excerpt": "St. Anne's Financial Information For most of its history, like many small Episcopal Parishes, St. Anne’s has struggled financially. The current church building was originally envisioned as a parish hall, with a plan to b…",
    "html": "<div>\n\n<strong>St. Anne's Financial Information</strong>\n\nFor most of its history, like many small Episcopal Parishes,  St. Anne’s has struggled financially.  The current church building was originally envisioned as a parish hall, with a plan to build a separate sanctuary at some point in time.  In 2000, this dream was reconsidered, and St. Anne’s  sold a portion of our land and  the Deaf Senior Center was built adjacent to our property (not a part of St. Anne’s though)..).  The proceeds from that sale have been invested in a money market account and are used to help us meet operating expenses each year.  It is our dream to finish each year “in the black” but our reality has been that we need to spend a small portion of our savings every year to meet operating expenses.\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Statement of Income and Expenses</strong></p>\n\n<table width=\"590\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>2016 Actual</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>2017 Actual</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>2018 Actual (1/2018 – 6/2018)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"><strong>Income:</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Pledge Payments</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$146,081</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$164,805</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$100,008</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Plate Offerings</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$4,234</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$1,988</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$2,998</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Targeted Offerings</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$8,237</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$2,469</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$1,247</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Space Use Donations</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$4,746</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$7,440</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$4,400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Scrip</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$16</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$366</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$78</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"><strong>TOTAL INCOME</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$173,314</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$177,068</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$108,731</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"><strong>Expenses:</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Congregational Life</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$7,145</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$7,134</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$3,492</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Outreach</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$4,410</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$3,915</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Diocese/Deanery</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$25,147</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$20,757</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$11,854</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Personnel Expenses</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$122,116</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$117,649</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$59,867</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Facilities/Grounds</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$53,603</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$35,593</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$17,058</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Office Supplies</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$2,629</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$3,107</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$2,077</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\">Financial Fees and Audit</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$15</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$365</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n<td width=\"132\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"><strong>TOTAL EXPENSES</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$215,065</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$188,520</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$94,393</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"193\"><strong>Income - Expenses</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>($41,751)</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>($11,452)</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$14,338</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<strong><u>Other Financial Data – As of June 30, 2018</u></strong><strong>:</strong>\n<table width=\"457\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"325\">Wells Fargo Checking Balance</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$19,618</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"325\">Smith Barney Total Value</td>\n<td width=\"132\">$151,974</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"325\"><strong>TOTAL CASH BALANCE</strong></td>\n<td width=\"132\"><strong>$171,592</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\n</div>"
